      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu Awonya Abalwadde",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu n'abuna wonna mu Ggaliraaya ng'ayigiriza mu makuŋŋaaniro g'Abayudaaya ng'abuulira Enjiri ey'obwakabaka obw'omu ggulu, era ng'awonya buli ndwadde yonna n'obuyongobevu bwonna mu bantu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amawulire ag'ebyamagero bye yakolanga ne gatuuka mu Siriya yonna. Ne bamuleetera abayongobevu, n'abalina ebibabonyaabonya, n'ab'ensimbu n'abo abaaliko baddayimooni, abakoozimbye n'ab'endwadde endala ezitali zimu, bonna n'abawonya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebibiina binene ne bimugoberera, abantu nga bava mu Ggaliraaya ne mu Dekapoli,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ne mu Yerusaalemi ne mu Buyudaaya yonna, n'emitala w'omugga Yoludaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.4.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
